DESCRIPTION:<p>Celebrating the Black pioneers of Brooklyn\, this trolley to
 
ur honors the trailblazers at rest in Green-Wood who shaped art\, activism\
 
, music\, and medicine. Visit the memorials of revolutionary artist Jean-Mi
 
chel Basquiat\, civil rights leaders Grace Nail Johnson and James Weldon Jo
 
hnson\, mathematic Tickets & info: https://www.green-wood.com/event/the-rev
 
olution-continues-brooklyns-black-trailblazers/
