LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>Think all sparrows look the same? Guess again! Small\, speed
 
y\, and often overlooked\, sparrows can be some of the trickiest birds to i
 
dentify\, but with a few helpful tips\, you’ll soon be telling your Song 
 
Sparrows from your White-throated Sparrows. </p>\\n Tickets & info: https:/
 
